{"schema":"hsr-localizations.v1","language":"zh-CN","entryId":"divergent-universe","chapterId":"event-tourn-104","referenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","rows":[{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-104-talk-403816440-line","text":"你坐在水晶海洋的堤坝上，硕大的羽鲸穿过物质世界的边缘，纵身跃起，又迅速落回璀璨的晶体结构中。","speaker":"模拟宇宙"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-104-talk-403816441-line","text":"上百上千的垂钓者相互拥挤，他们手握相位偏移鱼竿，任凭饵料沉入水晶深处。","speaker":"模拟宇宙"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-104-talk-403816442-line","text":"迪喀纳人以垂钓的方式向水晶母亲献上祈祷，母亲会顺应每个人的意识，给予相应的回报。说罢，大祭司将一块黄金挂在鱼钩上，用力抛投向固体海洋。","speaker":"模拟宇宙"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-104-talk-403816443-line","text":"「简单来说就是，只要献上祭品，你能在这里钓上任何东西，甚至包括鱼。」向导毫无敬畏地翻译道。","speaker":"模拟宇宙"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-104-text-8301303226263351359-choice","text":"我想获得财富。","speaker":""},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-104-text-783426986526624586-effect","text":"钓起宇宙碎片。","speaker":""},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-104-text-5265670094978223787-choice","text":"我想获得恩赐。","speaker":""},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-104-text-15470112753890663528-effect","text":"钓起祝福。","speaker":""},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-104-text-12061773884852176520-choice","text":"我想触及未知。","speaker":""},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-104-text-5108635307258160221-effect","text":"钓起奇物。","speaker":""},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-104-text-3469998025023919542-choice","text":"我想触及智慧。","speaker":""},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-104-text-1611032889360015594-effect","text":"钓起方程。","speaker":""},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-104-text-16446495829302644396-choice","text":"放弃垂钓。","speaker":""},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-104-text-11257728377065666812-effect","text":"选择离开。","speaker":""},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-104-talk-403816444-line","text":"一入钓鱼深似海，想想你空空如也的钱包，顿时就没那么想抛竿了。","speaker":"模拟宇宙"}]}
